    "description": "<p>The Dragon-Blood knows precisely how to shatter unit cohesion — not through brute force but through precise strikes at command nodes and communications. This Charm supplements a unit attack action. On a successful attack, if the unit deals any Magnitude damage, the target unit must immediately make a Rout check at −2 regardless of how much Magnitude it lost. If the target unit has no officer or special character acting as a relay this action, the difficulty of this Rout check increases by an additional 2 (total −4 compared to the standard). If the attack fails to deal Magnitude damage, the Charm has no effect.</p>",
